{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nTODAY\nToday\nOrders\nBilling / Invoices\nPayments & Split\nRegister shifts & cash\nKITCHEN\nKitchen progress\nKitchen tickets\nMENU\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nTABLES\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nGUESTS & TEAM\nCustomers & loyalty\nTeam & permissions\nREPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nActivity history\nDEVICES\nPrinters & Devices\nConnections & sync\nApp Downloads\nSETUP\nReceipt & E-Bill\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\n\nQR Ordering license active · JAMANVAAR QR · Valid through 12/11/2026. Your platform administrator manages licenses and device reassignment.\n\nQR Ordering\n\nGuests scan the code on their table, order from your menu, and the order reaches your counter and kitchen.\n\nEnabled\nOverview\nQR Orders\nService Requests\nMenu & Availability\nTables & QR\nCustomer Branding\nPayment Settings\nOrdering Rules\nAdvanced Features\nAnalytics\nCustomer page branding\n\nPreview your words, images and palette before saving. Your live guest page keeps the restaurant and table identity supplied by the QR code.\n\nWelcome heading\nWelcome message\nFooter message\nOrder button label\nAccent colour\nRestaurant logo\nUse default logo\nOptional advanced branding\n\nQR Branding is not included in this license.\n\nCover image\nUse menu cover\nLight background\nMenu presentation\nImage cards\nCompact list\nContact / assistance message\nSave branding\nDiscard changes\n\nSTYLE PREVIEW · SAMPLE DATA · NO LIVE ORDER\n\nMenu\nCart\nCheckout\nMobile\nDesktop\nYour restaurant\nMain branch · Table 1\nFRESH FROM OUR KITCHEN\nGood food.\nGreat company.\n\nPick your favourites, make them yours, and let us take care of the rest.\n\nOur menu\nSample Gujarati Thali\n\nShaak, dal, rice and rotli\n\n₹299\n\nPlace order · ₹299\n\nCustom domains require verified DNS ownership, TLS and routing setup by the platform administrator. Customer links currently use the configured platform domain.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
